00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:51.910
You know, first off, we are a country where
everyone has some kind of immigrant story.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:57.210
Even Native Americans these days are heavily
intermarried with people of immigrant origin.

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:02.570
And so almost every single American is touched
somehow by a journey to this country, and

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:05.870
that is something that is remarkably unifying.

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:12.529
Secondly, we have a really high rate of intermarriage
and mixed ethnic ethnicity, mixed religion,

