is blurring the boundaries between people

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:27.300
that can otherwise be used to divide us.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:31.529
And so we also have a very strong civic idea
of what it is to be an American.

00:16:31.529 --> 00:16:36.190
And so these are all advantages, I think,
in crafting that new American story that other

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:41.280
