and heritage of immigration that continues

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:42.650
into the future.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:47.980
And so in many ways, America is not one static
thing, and it's, you know, it's a fool's errand

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.100
to try to create something monolithic.

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:51.500
It's just not who we are.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:55.920
We're an evolving place where an idea where
a country that is constantly in motion, always

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:56.920
under construction.

